   </condition>
   <condition type="2">
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Paragraph 2(a)(iii)	Fiscal Agent Certificate</narrative>
   </condition>
   <condition type="2">
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Paragraph 2(a)(iv)	Procurement Agent Certificate</narrative>
   </condition>
   <condition type="2">
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prior to the initial CIF Disbursement: 
(a) The Government (or MiDA) has delivered to MCC: 
(i) an interim fiscal accountability plan acceptable to MCC; and 
(ii) a CIF procurement plan acceptable to MCC. 
(iii) evidence of the Government&#xFFFD;s intent to proceed with an Acceptable ECG PSP Transaction, in a form and substance acceptable to MCC; 
(iv) a copy of the Gas Action Plan approved by the Government in a form and substance acceptable to MCC; 
(v) a copy of the Electric Distribution Utility Payment Action Plan approved by the Government, in a form and substance acceptable to MCC; and 
(vi) evidence of approval and implementation of quarterly tariff adjustments in accordance with formula that became effective prior to the initial CIF Disbursement.</narrative>
   </condition>
  </conditions>
